From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 06:14:06 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] images: bind the host's EGL and ODM only for HALIUM
 vendors

mount_rootfs() bind-mounts the host's /vendor/lib*/egl over the
container's, and the host's /odm (or /vendor/odm) to odm_extra, on every
host that has them. Both are only meant for HALIUM vendor images, which
run on the host's vendor blobs. A MAINLINE vendor image ships its own
EGL (Mesa, ANGLE), and the EGL bind hides it.

This happens on any host that has a /vendor/lib*/egl but whose vendor
type comes out MAINLINE. The BraX3, a Halium host with an SDK 36 vendor
and no ro.vndk.version, was one before e7d73e7. There the container saw
only the host's Mali libraries, which are of no use with the image's
gralloc. SurfaceFlinger and hwcomposer aborted with "couldn't find an
OpenGL ES implementation", and Android never booted.

Skip both binds when the vendor type is MAINLINE, as is already done for
vendor_extra in the LXC config.

Signed-off-by: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
Upstream-Status: Submitted [https://github.com/waydroid/waydroid/pull/2479]
---
 tools/helpers/images.py | 21 +++++++++++----------
 1 file changed, 11 insertions(+), 10 deletions(-)

diff --git a/tools/helpers/images.py b/tools/helpers/images.py
index 807cdde..e5cadca 100644
--- a/tools/helpers/images.py
+++ b/tools/helpers/images.py
@@ -235,17 +235,18 @@ def mount_rootfs(args, images_dir, session):
                                     upper_dir=tools.config.defaults["overlay_rw"] + "/vendor",
                                     work_dir=tools.config.defaults["overlay_work"] + "/vendor")
 
-    for egl_path in ["/vendor/lib/egl", "/vendor/lib64/egl"]:
-        if os.path.isdir(egl_path):
+    if cfg["waydroid"]["vendor_type"] != "MAINLINE":
+        for egl_path in ["/vendor/lib/egl", "/vendor/lib64/egl"]:
+            if os.path.isdir(egl_path):
+                helpers.mount.bind(
+                    args, egl_path, tools.config.defaults["rootfs"] + egl_path)
+        if helpers.mount.ismount("/odm"):
             helpers.mount.bind(
-                args, egl_path, tools.config.defaults["rootfs"] + egl_path)
-    if helpers.mount.ismount("/odm"):
-        helpers.mount.bind(
-            args, "/odm", tools.config.defaults["rootfs"] + "/odm_extra")
-    else:
-        if os.path.isdir("/vendor/odm"):
-            helpers.mount.bind(
-                args, "/vendor/odm", tools.config.defaults["rootfs"] + "/odm_extra")
+                args, "/odm", tools.config.defaults["rootfs"] + "/odm_extra")
+        else:
+            if os.path.isdir("/vendor/odm"):
+                helpers.mount.bind(
+                    args, "/vendor/odm", tools.config.defaults["rootfs"] + "/odm_extra")
 
     make_prop(args, session, args.work + "/waydroid.prop")
     helpers.mount.bind_file(args, args.work + "/waydroid.prop",
